        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Battlestar Galactica (miniseries)\n- People: Edward James Olmos, Mary McDonnell, Ronald D. Moore, Michael Rymer, Brenda McDonald, Kirk Whisler\n- Organizations: Latino Literacy Now, Reforma\n- Awards: Latino Book Awards\n\nFacts:\n- Edward James Olmos was born on February 24, 1947, and he is an American actor and director.\n- Battlestar Galactica is a three-hour miniseries comprising four broadcast hours.\n- Battlestar Galactica stars Edward James Olmos and Mary McDonnell.\n- Battlestar Galactica was written and produced by Ronald D. Moore and directed by Michael Rymer.\n- Brenda McDonald has appeared in over 40 films and television shows, including Elf, Closer, Battlestar Galactica, Supernatural, and The X-Files.\n- Latino Book Awards are produced by Latino Literacy Now and Reforma.\n- Latino Literacy Now was co-founded by Edward James Olmos and Kirk Whisler.",
